msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip01"
msgid "Want to play with others? Open “Room list” on the title screen. Pick a room to join and you’ll enter its lobby."
msgstr "想和其他玩家一起玩吗？打开标题画面的“房间列表”吧。选择要加入的房间，就能进入大厅。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip02
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip02"
msgid "Want to host your own room? Press the “Create room” button in the Room list to set the room name, map and max players."
msgstr "想自己创建房间吗？在“房间列表”中点击“创建房间”按钮，就能设置房间名称、地图和最大人数。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip03
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip03"
msgid "Met a player you’d like to see again? Look for their “Add friend” button in the lobby’s player list."
msgstr "有想再次相遇的玩家吗？在大厅的玩家列表中找找对方的“添加好友”按钮吧。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip04
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip04"
msgid "Want to meet your friends in the same room? Try “Invite friends” in the lobby. Why not call over a friend to play with?"
msgstr "想和好友在同一个房间相见吗？试试大厅里的“邀请好友”吧。叫上好友一起玩怎么样？"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip05
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip05"
msgid "New to the game? Open “Guide” on the title screen. You’ll find everything from the game rules to how to use Pandoras and items."
msgstr "对游戏还不熟悉？打开标题画面的“指南”吧。从游戏规则到潘多拉和物品的使用说明，都能在这里找到。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip06
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip06"
msgid "Curious about your current tier? Check “Records” on the title screen for your tier, win count and past match records."
msgstr "想知道自己现在的段位吗？在标题画面的“战绩”中查看段位、胜利次数和以往的比赛记录吧。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip07
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip07"
msgid "Created a room? Pick an arena in the lobby, too. Use the Previous map and Next map buttons in Map selection to browse other arenas."
msgstr "创建房间后，也在大厅里挑选一下竞技场吧。通过“选择地图”中的“上一张地图”和“下一张地图”按钮，可以浏览其他竞技场。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip08
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip08"
msgid "Got the same weapon or equipment again? Combine duplicate weapons or equipment in your Inventory to upgrade them."
msgstr "又获得了相同的武器或装备吗？在背包中合成重复的武器或装备，就能进行强化。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip09
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip09"
msgid "Not sure which weapon to use? Visit “Training” on the title screen. Try out different weapons yourself and find the one that suits you."
msgstr "不知道该用哪种武器？去标题画面的“训练场”看看吧。亲手试用各种武器，找到最顺手的那一把。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip10
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip10"
msgid "Skill descriptions show not only effects but also mana cost and cooldown. Check how much mana you need and how long until you can use it again."
msgstr "技能说明中不仅有效果，还能查看法力消耗和冷却时间。一起看看所需的法力和再次使用前需要等待的时间吧。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip11
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip11"
msgid "The Fire Pandora’s “Burning Flare” deals damage over time with a zone of flames, while “Great Flame Sphere” launches a fireball. Both use fire, but they attack in different ways."
msgstr "火焰的“燃烧耀斑”会以火焰区域造成持续伤害，而“巨型火焰球”则会发射火球。同样是火，攻击方式却不同哦。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip12
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip12"
msgid "The Freeze Pandora’s “Icicle” fires an ice projectile, while “Frost Spike” makes ice spikes burst from the ground. Learn to tell their attacks apart."
msgstr "冰冻的“冰锥”会射出冰霜投射物，而“寒霜尖刺”会让冰刺从地面升起。试着分辨这两种技能的攻击方式吧。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip13
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip13"
msgid "The Freeze Pandora’s “Ice Age” strikes nearby enemies. Unlike skills that fire ice projectiles, it’s great for dealing with enemies up close."
msgstr "冰冻的“冰河时代”是攻击周围敌人的技能。与发射冰霜投射物的技能不同，对付近处的敌人时试着用用看吧。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip14
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip14"
msgid "The Darkness Pandora’s “Dark Stain” isn’t fired at enemies—it empowers you. Try using it before you start attacking."
msgstr "黑暗的“暗蚀”不是射向敌人的技能，而是强化自身的技能。在开始进攻前试着使用吧。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip15
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip15"
msgid "The Darkness Pandora’s “Blackhole” pulls in nearby enemies. Remember that it gathers foes together, and get your next attack ready."
msgstr "黑暗的“黑洞”会把周围的敌人吸引过来。记住这是聚集敌人的技能，准备好下一次攻击吧。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip16
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip16"
msgid "The Darkness Pandora’s “Void Ray” is an attack that fires a beam from your hand. Its role is different from “Dark Stain”, which empowers you."
msgstr "黑暗的“虚空射线”是从手中发射光线的攻击技能。它和强化自身的“暗蚀”作用不同哦。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip17
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip17"
msgid "To restore health, use the Light Pandora’s “Luminary Pulse”. To move quickly, try “Lightspeed”."
msgstr "想恢复生命值，就用光明的“辉光脉冲”；想快速移动，就试试“光速”吧。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip18
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip18"
msgid "The Lightning Pandora’s “Lightning Flash” dashes forward and strikes enemies in its path. To hit a specific spot, try “Thunder Strike”, which calls down a lightning bolt."
msgstr "闪电的“闪电突袭”会向前冲刺，攻击撞到的敌人。想攻击特定位置的话，试试降下落雷的“雷霆打击”吧。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip19
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip19"
msgid "The Machine Pandora’s “Guided Missile” tracks enemies and deals area damage. It attacks differently from “Plasma Beam”, which fires a beam."
msgstr "机械的“制导导弹”是追踪敌人并造成范围伤害的技能。它的攻击方式和发射光束的“等离子束”不同哦。"

#. Key:	Title.LunaTip20
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.LunaTip20"
msgid "The Machine Pandora isn’t all about attacks. “Defense Field” creates a protective field around you."
msgstr "机械的潘多拉可不只有攻击技能。“防御力场”能展开守护自身的防护场哦。"

#. Key:	Title.QuickHint
#. SourceLocation:	UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
#: UI/Localization/StringTables/MenuText.csv
msgctxt "MenuText,Title.QuickHint"
msgid "Jump into the battle"
msgstr "立即加入战斗"

